    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\theta\\approx63^\\circ$. Use $m=2$ and $\\theta=\\tan^{-1}(2)$; sketch through $(2,0)$ and $(0,-4)$.",
      "worked": "For the sketch, find the intercepts:\n$$\\begin{align*}y&=2(0)-4=-4\\\\0&=2x-4\\\\x&=2\\end{align*}$$\nDraw the line through $(0,-4)$ and $(2,0)$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\tan\\theta&=2\\\\\\theta&=\\tan^{-1}(2)\\\\\\theta&\\approx63^\\circ\\end{align*}$$",
